{"sha": "a3a57c5ef98bc4f6c141685b8e0710fd8ff5b1ec536d6cc11ac8e040dda3aa2e", "body": ["\\begin{remark}\\label{rem:g11:fundamental-interactions:torsion}", "库仑于 1785 年通过测量一根细扭丝的扭转，建立了该定律；", "为何指数恰为 $2$，将在大学分册中解答。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!20] (0,0) circle (0.3) node[black] {$+$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!20] (2.6,0) circle (0.3) node[black] {$+$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (-0.3,0) -- (-1.5,0)", "    node[midway, above] {$\\vect F_{2/1}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (2.9,0) -- (4.1,0)", "    node[midway, above] {$\\vect F_{1/2}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!20] (0,0) circle (0.3) node[black] {$+$};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, fill=omProp!25] (2.6,0) circle (0.3) node[black] {$-$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (0.3,0) -- (1.1,0)", "    node[midway, above] {$\\vect F_{2/1}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (2.3,0) -- (1.5,0)", "    node[midway, above] {$\\vect F_{1/2}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同号电荷相斥（左），异号电荷相吸（右）；", "两力大小始终相等、方向相反。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[与引力的形式对应]\\label{rem:g11:fundamental-interactions:twin}", "库仑定律在符号上与万有引力定律", "（见\\cref{ch:g10:universal-gravitation}）完全相同，只需把质量换成电荷：", "\\begin{center}", "\\begin{tabular}{lll}", "源 & 质量 $m$ & 电荷 $q$ \\\\", "定律 & $F = G\\,\\dfrac{m_1 m_2}{d^2}$ & $F = k\\,\\dfrac{\\abs{q_1 q_2}}{d^2}$ \\\\[1.5ex]", "常量 & $G = \\qty{6.67e-11}{N.m^2/kg^2}$ & $k = \\qty{8.99e9}{N.m^2/C^2}$ \\\\", "符号 & 始终为引力 & 可为引力或斥力 \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "下文的两点差异是全部内容的基础：电相互作用远强于引力，", "且只有电相互作用可以相互抵消。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[两个质子，两种力同时作用]\\label{ex:g11:fundamental-interactions:protons}", "两个质子（$m_p = \\qty{1.67e-27}{kg}$）相距 $d = \\qty{1.0e-15}{m}$，", "即原子核内的近邻。电斥力为：", "\\[", "F_E = \\num{8.99e9} \\times", "\\frac{(\\num{1.60e-19})^{2}}{(\\num{1.0e-15})^{2}}", "\\approx \\qty{2.3e2}{N}", "\\]", "——相当于一只 $23$ 千克箱子所受的重力，而承载它的只是", "一个质量为 $10^{-27}$ 千克的粒子。万有引力为：", "$F_G = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times (\\num{1.67e-27})^{2} /", "(\\num{1.0e-15})^{2} \\approx \\qty{1.9e-34}{N}$。比值", "$F_E / F_G = k e^{2} / (G m_p^{2}) \\approx \\num{1.2e36}$ is", "与距离无关（$d^{2}$ 相消）：对于基本粒子，", "引力弱了约 $10^{36}$ 倍，以至于在\\emph{任何}距离下都无足轻重。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{强相互作用与弱相互作用}", "", "上例留下了一个疑问：氦核中的两个质子", "以数十牛的斥力相互排斥，而氦核却依然存在。", "", "\\begin{definition}[强相互作用]\\label{def:g11:fundamental-interactions:strong}", "\\emph{强相互作用}\\index{强相互作用}将夸克", "束缚成核子，又将核子束缚成原子核。在 \\qty{e-15}{m} 处它是", "吸引力，且远强于电斥力（核子间可达", "数千牛）；超过几个 $10^{-15}$ 米后，它便消失了：", "其\\emph{作用范围}\\index{作用范围（相互作用的）}约为", "\\qty{e-15}{m}。它对质子和中子一视同仁，与电荷无关。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!20] (0,0) circle (0.34) node[black] {p};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!20] (3.2,0) circle (0.34) node[black] {p};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (-0.34,0) -- (-1.7,0)", "    node[midway, above] {$F_E \\approx \\qty{230}{N}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (3.54,0) -- (4.9,0) node[midway, above] {$F_E$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, very thick] (0.2,0.55) -- (1.45,0.55)", "    node[midway, above] {强};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, very thick] (3.0,0.55) -- (1.75,0.55)", "    node[midway, above] {强};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (0,-0.65) -- (3.2,-0.65)", "    node[midway, below] {$d = \\qty{1.0e-15}{m}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 原子核内的拉锯：在 $10^{-15}$~m 处，强", "吸引力（数千牛）胜过电斥力。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[为何原子核能够存在——以及为何重核会衰变]\\label{rem:g11:fundamental-interactions:nuclei}", "原子核内的两种力随距离的变化方式不同。强“胶水”作用距离短：", "一个核子只与其邻近的少数核子结合，范围在 \\qty{e-15}{m} 以内。", "电斥力作用距离长：每个质子都会排斥", "\\emph{其他每一个}质子。随着原子核增大，斥力的累积速度快于“胶水”的结合力：", "重核需要更多中子（中子不带电，只起“胶水”作用），", "而当质子数超过约 $80$ 时，即便如此也不够——", "最重的原子核只能“借来”的时间存在（见\\cref{ch:g11:nucleus-radioactivity}）。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{definition}[弱相互作用]\\label{def:g11:fundamental-interactions:weak}", "\\emph{弱相互作用}\\index{弱相互作用}，其作用范围更短，", "亦可使中子转变为质子（反之亦然）：它驱动", "\\cref{ch:g11:nucleus-radioactivity}中的 $\\beta$ 放射性。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\section{谁统治哪一层}", ""]}